PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

RESOLVED that the General Partner subscribes to the initial capital contribution of GBP 1.00 as per the Partnership Agreement;
RESOLVED that the registered office of the Exempted Limited Partnership shall be established at [Registered Office], Gibraltar, and the Board of Directors adopts the same and authorizes the filing of the Certificate of Registration;
RESOLVED that the initial officers of the General Partner are appointed as [Director Name] as Managing Director, [Secretary Name] as Company Secretary, and [Authorized Signatory Name] as additional officer;
RESOLVED that the Partnership Agreement is hereby adopted and ratified, and the General Partner is authorized to take all actions necessary for the statutory formation, governance, and operation of the Exempted Limited Partnership in Gibraltar.

This resolution is passed unanimously by the Board of Directors on [Date].
